~ start
do Gs._stop()
Narrator: You need go to meeting room
set Gs.event = "meeting"
do Gs._play()
=> END

~ meet
do Gs._stop()
Methodologist: I have developed a new methodology for selling our new product.
Richard: And what kind of product is it?
methodologist: I present to your attention a completely relevant product that will be sold to the last unit!
director: Don't Tom, introduce your bike already!
Employee: * drumming on the table with a shot *
methodologist: Devourer of air!
Director: ...
Richard: ...
secretary: ...
security guard: This is A MASTERPIECE!!!
manager: This is...
Richard: Unnecessary...
employee: Empty...
secretary: Outdated...
economist: Expensive...
accountant: Sophisticated...
director: Great idea! We're starting to release!
Janitor: Great! Get out of here, I need to wash up.
=> end_meet
=> END

~ end_meet
Narrator: That's the end of the meeting, and the assignment for today is on your screen.
do vis()
do Gs._play()
=> END